{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NTS518Zms3vrpiGNTe2Egm","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on my search of the context filesystem, I found information about the Diskless Topics KIP ecosystem and can provide the following answer:\\\\n\\\\n## Diskless Topics KIP Metadata and Status\\\\n\\\\n**KIP-1150: Diskless Topics** is the motivational KIP with extensive design discussions [DISCUSS] ongoing in the community.\\\\n\\\\n**Related KIPs and their status:**\\\\n\\\\n1. **KIP-1181 (Metadata Change Proposal) - DEPRECATED**: According to the discussions, **KIP-1181 has been deprecated** because it is now **incorporated into KIP-1163**. This is stated explicitly in a response from Ivan Yurchenko: \\\\\\\"We have deprecated KIP-1181 as it's now incorporated into KIP-1163.\\\\\\\" (from `/store/events/2026/01/22/mail-3e8f59469c20bdceab1a1ca0-5c66fee4.md`)\\\\n\\\\n2. **KIP-1163: Diskless Core** - The primary design KIP that includes the metadata changes that were previously proposed in KIP-1181. This is the implementation-focused design for Diskless Topics.\\\\n\\\\n3. **KIP-1164: Batch Coordinator** - A follow-up implementation KIP for Diskless Topics, which handles the batch coordination component.\\\\n\\\\n4. **KIP-1254: Kafka Consumer Support for Remote Tiered Storage Fetch** - This serves as the **consumer-side companion** to KIP-1248, as referenced in the discussions at `/store/events/2026/01/07/mail-615f552c42093fa9f5e277c0-926ed506.md`.\\\\n\\\\n**Summary:** KIP-1181 (the metadata change proposal) was **deprecated and merged** into KIP-1163, making KIP-1163 the authoritative design document for Diskless Topics implementation.\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"store\\\",\\\"events/2026/01/07/mail-615f552c42093fa9f5e277c0-926ed506.md\\\",\\\"events/2026/01/12/mail-ea210866a1277c46b831a7bd-e1f172d1.md\\\",\\\"events/2026/01/22/mail-3e8f59469c20bdceab1a1ca0-5c66fee4.md\\\"],\\\"seconds